


--> Derived Query Methods
    Spring creates queries from method names

    | Keyword | Meaning |
    | ------- | ------- |
    | And     | AND     |
    | Or      | OR      |
    | Between | Range   |
    | Like    | Pattern |
    | OrderBy | Sorting |


